				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom))
		(uuid "992d7dc5-b5f1-5da3-a81f-b1ebb7b24fb9"))
	(text "Q4 when the CoreInk requests (G26 high), Q5 when the existing reader requests. D7 passes the reader's"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 220.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom))
		(uuid "57653a7d-e658-5397-b2f2-4d6a3ad9557c"))
	(text "own request on when V5 is absent (DSMR 2/3 meter with the CoreInk off). G34 tells the firmware that"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom))
		(uuid "08240bc1-430a-5686-a709-70e0a85ef8aa"))
	(text "the reader requests. R15 (not fitted): always request. LED2 (yellow): data requested."
